{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Find a licensed lawyer"},"description":"Use when someone wants a lawyer for a U.S. legal matter, e.g. \"find an affordable tenant lawyer in Santa Ana\" or \"I was fired after complaining, who can help in Los Angeles\". Needs state and matter type (or a short description). Returns up to 5 licensed lawyers with reasons, a relevance score, a separate data_confidence level, license source and check date, whether they are known to take private clients, directory profile links and a suggested citation, or an honest no-match with legal-aid options. Unknown fees and availability are labeled unknown. Court and government lawyers are left out unless they said they take private clients. Records an anonymous search log only. Not legal advice.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"accessibility_needs":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"attribution_token":{"description":"Signed campaign/partner token issued by ESQ Matching Engine, if the user arrived through a partner link","maxLength":600,"type":"string"},"billing_preference":{"enum":["hourly","flat_fee","contingency","retainer","any"],"type":"string"},"budget_max":{"description":"Total budget the user mentioned, in US dollars","maximum":10000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"budget_min":{"maximum":10000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"category":{"enum":["civil","criminal","administrative","transactional","family","other"],"type":"string"},"city":{"maxLength":80,"type":"string"},"client_side":{"description":"Which side the user is on. ESQ Matching Engine has no record of which side lawyers usually represent, so results carry a warning to ask.","enum":["tenant","landlord","employee","employer","plaintiff","defendant","buyer","seller","other","unknown"],"type":"string"},"communication":{"enum":["phone","email","video","in_person","any